Package: qte-popups
Version: 1.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Maintainer: You <you@example.com>
Description: Random quick-time event popups for your desktop
 Randomly pops up game-style quick-time events (press the key, mash the
 key) at random places on the screen. Succeed or fail, life goes on.
